    "chunk_text": "Description of the land/servitude to be acquired : The 2 Allotments of land in total extent of 0.6070 Hectares depicted in Block No. 04 of Sheet No. 01 in plan marked C. M. No. 810239 dated 31.12.2024 made by District Superintendent of Surveys Galle District, situated in the Village of Walahanduwa, in the Grama Niladhari Division of No. 112A, Walahanduwa in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Akmeemana, District of Galle, Southern Province as follows :\n\n01. Lot No. 01 Name of the Land: Walahanduwawatta; Claimant : Government; Extent: 0.0203 Hectare.\n\n02. Lot No. 02 Name of the Land: Walahanduwawatta; Claimant : Government; Extent: 0.5867 Hectare.\n\nNorth by : Walahanduwawatta claimed by Land Reforms Commission (T.P. 83107 and 83106) Lot No. 01 of the same sheet and Walahanduwawatta claimed by Land Reforms Commission (T. P. 83108); East by : Walahanduwawatta claimed by Land Reforms Commission (T.P. 83106) Lot No. 01 of the same sheet and Walahanduwawatta claimed by Land Reforms Commission (T. P. 83108 and 83107); South by : Walahanduwawatta claimed by Land Reforms Commission (T.P. 83107); West by : Walahanduwawatta claimed by Land Reforms Commission (T.P. 83107 and 83106).\n\nAll persons interested in the aforesaid Land are hereby required to appear personally or by agents duly authorized in writing before me at Divisional Secretariat, Akmeemana on 24.09.2025 at 10.00 a.m. and are hereby requested to notify me in writing (in duplicated) on or before 17.09.2025, of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.\n\nT. G. S. Sajeewani, Divisional Secretary, Akmeemana. At Divisional Secretariat - Akmeemana, 20th June, 2025. EOG 07 - 0011\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
