    "chunk_text": "The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u0dc1\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0db4\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dca\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dd3 \u0da2\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dba\u0dda \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0da7\u0dca \u0db4\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dc1\u0dd9\u0dc2\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2443/33 - 2025 \u0da2\u0dd6\u0dbd\u0dd2 \u0db8\u0dc3 01 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u0db1\u0dd2 \u0d85\u0d9f\u0dc4\u0dbb\u0dd4\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf - 2025.07.01\n\nNo. 2443/33 - TUESDAY, JULY 01, 2025\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice under Section 7\n\nMy No.: KDS/HAR/4/2/1/60. Ministry of Agriculture, Livestock, Land and Irrigation\n\nNo. : 4-3/18/2021/WS/423. I hereby give notice under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act No. 28 of 1964 that the Government intends to acquire the plots of land described below for the construction of Abutment Wall of Uduwawala Service Reservoir under the Kandy North-Pathadumbara Integrated Water Supply Project.\n\nDescription of the land to be acquired : The Allotments of land described as follows, depicted as Lot Nos. 3, 4 in the tenement list 1, in Sheet No. 12 in Block 02 in the Cadastral Map No. 320320, surveyed and prepared by the Senior Superintendent of Surveys of Kandy District, situated at the Village of Uduwawala, in Uduwawala West Grama Niladhari Division No. 417, in Kulugammana Siyapattuwa Minor Division, in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Harispattuwa in Kandy District, Central Province and bounded as follows :\n\n01. Lot No. 03 Name of the Land: Galahitiyawe Watta; Claimant : State; Original Claimant : Sanjeewa Amaranath\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2014 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\n1A - G 044716 - 21 (07/2025)\n\nManamperi residing at No. 19/1, Udawawala, Katugastota; Extent: 0.0005 Hectare.\n\nNorth by : Lot Nos. 1, 2 and 5; East by : Lot Nos. 5 and 4; South by : Lot No. 76 in Sheet 1; West by : Lot No. 1.\n\n02. Lot No. 04 Name of the Land: Galahitiyawe Watta; Claimant : State; Original Claimant : Ihala Watte Gedara Leelawathi residing at No. 23/3, Uduwawala, Katugastota; Extent: 0.0028 Hectare."
