    "chunk_text": "North by : Lot Nos. 1, 2 and 5; East by : Lot Nos. 5 and 4; South by : Lot No. 76 in Sheet 1; West by : Lot No. 1.\n\n02. Lot No. 04 Name of the Land: Galahitiyawe Watta; Claimant : State; Original Claimant : Ihala Watte Gedara Leelawathi residing at No. 23/3, Uduwawala, Katugastota; Extent: 0.0028 Hectare.\n\nAll persons who claim ownership, interest or any other connection to the aforesaid land hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me on the 1st September, 2025 at 10.00 a.m. at the Divisional Secretariat, Harispattuwa.\n\nAnd further, you are hereby requested to notify me in writing in duplicate before 20th August, 2025 the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims\n\n2 A III \u0dba\u0d9a\u0ddc\u0da7\u0dc3 - \u0dc1\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0db4\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dca\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dd3 \u0da2\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dba\u0dda \u0dd2 \u0dc0 \u0dc1\u0dd9\u0dba \u0d9c \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0da7\u0dca \u0db4\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dba - 2025.07.01 Part III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 01.07.2025\n\nfor compensation for the acquisition of the said land, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.\n\nMohan Dharmadasa, Divisional Secretary, Harispattuwa. At Harispattuwa Divisional Secretariat, 26th June, 2025. EOG 07 - 0008\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice under Section 7\n\nMy No. : KDS/HAR/4/2/1/53. Ministry of Agriculture, Livestock, Land and Irrigation\n\nRef. No. : 4-3/12/2018/WS/291. I hereby give notice under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act No. 28 of 1964 that the Government intends to acquire the land described below for the construction of the Proposed Intake of Kundasale-Haragama Water Supply Project.\n\nDescription of the land to be acquired : All that allotment of land described as follows, depicted as Lot No. 1 in the tenement list 1, in sheet No. 7 in Block 03 in the Cadastral Map No. 320460, surveyed and prepared by the Senior Superintendent of Surveys of"
