    "chunk_text": "Description of the land to be acquired : All that allotment of land described as follows, depicted as Lot No. 1 in the tenement list 1, in sheet No. 7 in Block 03 in the Cadastral Map No. 320460, surveyed and prepared by the Senior Superintendent of Surveys of\n\n01. Lot No. 01 Name of the Land: Looleliwelekumbura; Claimant : State; Original Claimant : Chief Incumbant, Liyangasthenna Raja Maha Viharaya; Extent: 0.4111 Hectare.\n\nNorth by : Lot No. 36 in Sheet 1; East by : Lot No. 36 in Sheet No. 1 and Lot No. 2 in P.P. Maha 5380; South by : Lot No. 2 in P. P. Maha 5380 and Lot No. 112 in Sheet 1; West by : Lot No. 112 and 208 in Sheet No. 1.\n\nAll persons who claim ownership, interest or any other connection to the aforesaid Land hereby required to appear personally or by agents duly authorized in writing before me on the 08.09.2025 at 10.00 a.m. at the Divisional Secretariat, Harispattuwa.\n\nAnd further, you are hereby requested to notify me in writing (in duplicate) before 27.08.2025, the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.\n\nMohan Dharmadasa, Divisional Secretary, Harispattuwa. At Divisional Secretariat Harispattuwa, 26th June, 2025. EOG 07 - 0009\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
