    "chunk_text": "1A \u2013 G 044714 \u2013 24 (07/2025)This Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nIII \u0d9a\u0ddc\u02c1\u0ddc\u0da7\u0dc3 \u2013 \u0dc1\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf\u0dcf \u0db4\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dd3 \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dba\u0dda\u024f \u0d85\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dc1\u0dd9\u02e4\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0da7\u0dca \u0db4\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dba \u2013 2025.07.01PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 01.07.20252A\n\n03. Lot \u2018C\u2019 \u2013 Kahatagahawatta \u2013 Extent: Around 0.0125 Hectare North: the Road; East: the Road and Kahatagahawatta owned by B. G. Sarath Premachandra. B. G. Thusitha Shyamali and A. M. A. Gnanawathie; South: the land called Kahatagahawatta owned by B. G. Sarath Premachandra, B. G. Thusitha Shyamali and A. M. A. Gnanawathie and\n\nPradeshiya Sabha Road; West: Pradeshiya Sabha Road and the Road.\n\nK. D. Lal Kantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Land and Irrigation.\n\nMy No.: 4-3/8/2015/PC/141.Ministry of Agriculture, Livestock, Land and Irrigation,\u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d,Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla,20th May, 2025.\n\nEOG 07 \u2013 0005\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
