    "chunk_text": "w;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2443$10 - 2025 cqks ui 30 jeks i\u2248\u00f7od - 2025.06'30No. 2443/10 - MONDAY, JUNE 30, 2025\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART I : SECTION (I) \u2014 GENERAL\n\nGovernment Notifications\n\n1A - G 44711 - 09 (06/2025) This Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nL. D. B. 94/47 (IX)\n\nTHE TOWN AND COUNTRY PLANNING ORDINANCE (CHAPTER 269)\n\nOrder under Section 6(2)(b) and Section 21(2)(b)\n\nBY virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 6(2)(b) and Section 21 (2)(b) of the Town and Country Planning Ordinance (Chapter 269), I, Anura Karunathilaka, Minister of Urban Development, Construction and Housing, do, by this order, -\n\n(a) declare that the area of land called the \u201cSankapitti Purana Vihara Area\u201d specified in the Schedule hereto shall be an urban development area for the purpose of the aforesaid ordinance; and\n\n(b) direct that an outline physical plan shall be prepared for the \u201cSankapitti Purana Vihara Area\u201d.\n\nAnura Karunathilaka,Minister of Urban Development, Construction and Housing.\n\nColombo28th of June, 2025.\n\nI fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2025'06'30Part I : Sec. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 30.06.20252A\n\nSCHEDULE\n\nTHE AREA OF LAND COMPRISING SANKAPITTI PURANA VIHARA AREA\n\nAll that areas of the land containing in an extent of 1.2421 hectares comprising the Lot No. \u2018A\u2019 as depicted in Survey General\u2019s Tracing No. CO/KDW/2024/413 and dated October 16, 2024, situated in the Village of Kaduwela (Division Number 3 - Kaduwela within Kaduwela Municipal Area) within the Grama Niladari Division of 473A, Kaduwela within the Divisional Secretariat Division of Kaduwela in the Administrative District