    "chunk_text": "w;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2443$02 - 2025 cqks ui 30 jeks i\u00f7od - 2025'06'30No. 2443/02 - MONDAY, JUNE 30, 2025\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART I : SECTION (I) \u2014 GENERAL\n\nGovernment Notifications\n\n1A - G 44751 - 29 (07/2025) This Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nCUSTOMS NOTIFICATIONS (GENERAL)\n\nThe Customs Ordinance\n\nREGULATIONS UNDER SECTION 101 OF THE CUSTOMS ORDINANCE (CHAPTER 235)\n\nBY virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 101 read with the Section 145 (1) of the Customs Ordinance (Chapter 235), I, Anura Kumara Dissanayake, Minister of Finance, Planning and Economic Development, promulgate following regulations.\n\nAnura Kumara Dissanayake, Minister of Finance, Planning and Economic Development.Ministry of Finance, Planning and Economic Development,Colombo 01,30th June, 2025.\n\nRegulations\n\n01. These Regulations may be cited as the \u201cCustoms (Rate of Interest) Regulations No. 01 of 2025\u201d.\n\n02. The rate of the interest for the purpose of the Section 145 (1) of the Customs Ordinance in respect of every penalty and forfeiture in a sum of money incurred shall be the market rate of interest (per annum) in terms of Section 30 of the Debt Recovery (Special Provisions) Act, No. 2 of 1990, calculated on a daily basis (using each calendar year) from the date on which such penalty or forfeiture is incurred (i.e. from the date of the order) to the date of payment, irrespective of filing an appeal.\n\nI fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2025'06'30Part I : Sec. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 30.06.20252A\n\n03. Interest shall be calculated on a simple interest basis (per annum) on the unpaid amount of the penalty or forfeiture until the date of full payment."
