    "chunk_text": "PART III - LANDS NOTICE CALLING FOR CLAIMS TO PROPERTY OF INTESTATE R\u0d7e\u0d80\u0d82\u0d8c\u0d8d\u0d8b\u0d7a\u0d8d\u0d82\u0d88\u0d87 \u0d88\u0d7f T\u0d82\u0d8d\u0d85\u0d7e A\u0d7c\u0d8d, N\u0d88. 21 \u0d88\u0d7f 1998 (S\u0d7e\u0d7c\u0d8d\u0d82\u0d88\u0d87 55) REFERENCE the intestate property of late Mr. Weerarathna Arachchige Patabedige Geethani Weerarathna who resided in the village of Dehipagoda , in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Udunuwara, in the District of Kandy. It is hereby notified that any person/s who have a claim to or interest in the intestate property of the late Mr. Weerarathna Arachchige Patabedige Geethani Weerarathna described in the Schedule hereto should submit his/their claim to the undersigned in writing before 18th July, 2025 seting his/their right or interest to such intestate property. In case of failure to do so, ex parte action will be taken to register title under Section 55 (2) and (3) of the Registration of Title Act. No. 21 of 1998. P. C. D. SIGERA, Commissioner General of Land Title Settlement. Land Title Settlement Department, No. 1200/6, \u201cMihikatha Madura\u201d, Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla, 09th June, 2025.\n\nN.B. \u2013 This Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk.\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\n\u0dc1\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0db4\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dd3 \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u0dba\u0dca \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0da7\u0dca \u0db4\u0dad\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 EXTRAORDINARY The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2442/77 - 2025 \u0da2\u0dd4\u0db1\u0dd2 \u0db8\u0dc3 28 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u0db1\u0dd2 \u0dd9\u0dc3\u0db1\u0dc3\u0dd4\u0dbb\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf - 2025.06.28\n\nNo. 2442/77 \u2013 SATURDAY, JUNE 28, 2025\n\nG 044694 - 04 (06/2025)\n\n2 A III \u0dd9\u0d9a\u0ddc\u0da7\u0dc3 - \u0dc1\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u