    "chunk_text": "NOTICE CALLING FOR CLAIMS TO PROPERTY OF INTESTATE R\u0d7e\u0d80\u0d82\u0d8c\u0d8d\u0d8b\u0d7a\u0d8d\u0d82\u0d88\u0d87 \u0d88\u0d7f T\u0d82\u0d8d\u0d85\u0d7e A\u0d7c\u0d8d, N\u0d88. 21 \u0d88\u0d7f 1998 (S\u0d7e\u0d7c\u0d8d\u0d82\u0d88\u0d87 55) REFERENCE the intestate property of late Mr. Warnakulasooriya Ichchampullige Joshap Fernando who resided in the village of Dummaladeniya, in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Wennappuwa , in the District of Puttalama. It is hereby notified that any person/s who have a claim to or interest in the intestate property of the late Mr. Warnakulasooriya Ichchampullige Joshap Fernando described in the Schedule hereto should submit his/their claim to the undersigned in writing before 18th July, 2025 setinghis/their right or interest to such intestate property. In case of failure to do so, ex parte action will be taken to register title under Section 55 (2) and (3) of the Registration of Title Act. No. 21 of 1998. P. C. D. SIGERA, Commissioner General of Land Title Settlement. Land Title Settlement Department, No. 1200/6, \u201cMihikatha Madura\u201d, Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla, 09th June, 2025. SCHEDULE Divisional Village Cadastral Parcel No. Extent of Land Certificate Office of Secretary\u2019s Division Map No. of Title No. Registration\n\n10 A III \u0dd9\u0d9a\u0ddc\u0da7\u0dc3 - \u0dc1\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0db4\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dd3 \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u0dba\u0dca \u0d85\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0da7\u0dca \u0db4\u0dad\u0dba - 2025.06.28 P\u0d7a\u0d8b\u0d8d III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRA ORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 28.06.2025\n\nSCHEDULE Divisional Village Cadastral Parcel No. Extent of Land Certificate Office of Secretary\u2019s Division Map No. of Title No. Registration\n\n(Hectare) Puttalama Dummaladeniya 410009 Block 01 0.0999 00240011789 Marawila Parcel No. 160 N.B.- Letters claiming a right to intestate property should mention the Cadastral Map number, parcel number and the entitlement of the claimant to claim such property. The top left-hand corner of the envelope should bear the phrase \u201cApplication for Intestate Property.\u201d EOG 06-301/13\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
