    "description": "Ministry of Labour - Industrial Dispute between Mr. P. M. Jayarathna Sri Lanka Transport Board.  Appt. of J. De Silva as an Arbitrator., Sri Lanka Nidahas Sevaka Sangama & Packserve Pvt. Ltd. Industrial Dispute between Mr. M. N. Abeykoon and Sri Lanka Transport Board.",
