of same Land, The Land Assmt.\n\nNo. 983 Kotte - Bope Road and Lot No. 2; South: Lot No. 2 and Kotte - Bope Road; West: Kotte - Bope Road and Susilarama Road.\n\n02. Lot No. 2 - Assmt. No. 983, Kotte - Bope Road - Extent: 0.0021 Hectare North: Lot No. 1, The Land Assmt. No. 991/1, 991/2 Kotte - Bope Road and Balance portion of same Land; East: Balance portion of same land, The Land Assmt. No. 997 Kotte - Bope Road and Lot No. 3; South: Lot No. 3 and Kotte - Bope Road; West: Kotte - Bope Road and Lot No. 1."
