    "chunk_text": "1AI \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3: (I) \u0dd9\u0da1\u0daf\u0dba \u2013 \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba \u2013 2025.05.30PART I: SEC. (I) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 30.05.2025\n\n\u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2442/49 \u2013 2025 \u0151\u01e7 \u0db8\u0dc3 26 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u01e7 \u022f\u0dc4\u0dc3\u0dca\u0db4\u01af\u01e6\u0daf\u0dcf \u2013 2025.06.26\n\nNo. 2442/49 \u2013 THURSDAY, JUNE 26, 2025\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART I: SECTION (I) \u2013 GENERAL\n\nGovernment Noti\ufb01cations\n\nTHE ANNUAL ESALA FESTIVAL SAPUGODA, KAMBURUPITIYA\n\nIn terms of the regulations published in 308 numbered Gazette of Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka issued on 27th of June, 1984, under the Pilgrimages Ordinance (Chapter 175), it is hereby noti\ufb01ed that Annual Esala Festival 2025 of Ilangamgoda Ancient Raja Maha Viharaya (Sapugoda Pirivena) Sapugoda, Kamburupitiya in Matara District, Southern Province will be held from 10th of July to 17th of July 2025.\n\nN.D.P. RANASINGHE, Divisional Secretary, Kamburupitiya.\n\nDivisional Secretariat,Kamburupitiya.20th June, 2025.\n\nEOG 06 \u2013 0262\n\n1A \u2013 G 044667 \u2013 09 (06/2025)\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
